{
  "name": "safety-interlocks",
  "skill_id": "safety-interlocks",
  "notes": [
    "Over-limit check has highest priority: measurement >= max_limit forces command = min_output and safety_triggered = true (skill lines 32, 50-52).",
    "Clamp step command = max(min_output, min(max_output, command)) is applied on both arms via Set expressions (skill line 33, 55).",
    "Both arms are exclusive terminals that report safety_triggered and output; no edge between them (skill lines 34-39).",
    "Inputs come from the trigger ($json.measurement, $json.command, $json.max_limit, $json.min_output, $json.max_output); no case.json file read (skill lines 16-27).",
    "Catalog search returned no nodes; node types taken from the provided schema list (if, set) plus manualTrigger."
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "name": "Case Input Trigger",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "slots": {},
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "31",
        "quote": "读取用例文件，取出上述字段。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "name": "Over-Limit Check (measurement >= max_limit)",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "slots": {
        "left": "={{ $json.measurement }}",
        "op": "gte",
        "right": "={{ $json.max_limit }}",
        "type": "number"
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "32",
        "quote": "**过限判定最高优先级**：`measurement >= max_limit` 时立即 `command = min_output`，并记 `safety_triggered = true`"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "name": "Emergency Cutoff Output",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "slots": {
        "assignments": {
          "safety_triggered": "={{ true }}",
          "output": "={{ Math.max($json.min_output, Math.min($json.max_output, $json.min_output)) }}",
          "command_before": "={{ $json.command }}",
          "event_type": "limit_exceeded",
          "limit": "={{ $json.max_limit }}",
          "measurement": "={{ $json.measurement }}"
        },
        "include_other_fields": true
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "50",
        "quote": "if measurement >= max_limit:"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "name": "Normal Path Clamp Output",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "slots": {
        "assignments": {
          "safety_triggered": "={{ false }}",
          "output": "={{ Math.max($json.min_output, Math.min($json.max_output, $json.command)) }}",
          "command_before": "={{ $json.command }}",
          "limit": "={{ $json.max_limit }}",
          "measurement": "={{ $json.measurement }}"
        },
        "include_other_fields": true
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "55",
        "quote": "command = max(min_output, min(max_output, command))"
      }
    }
  ],
